      "name": "bookmarks.list",
      "description": "List the connected user's private bookmarks, newest first. Returns metadata and excerpts, not saved content; use bookmarks.get to read a snapshot. limit is 1–50 (default 50). Pass a nonzero next_cursor as the numeric before argument, retaining filters. Use site from bookmarks.sites, or related_to bookmark_slug with section=site (same site) or more (other sites). Empty results are valid.",
